WEBVTT

00:07.330 --> 00:08.990
I'm going to head home.

00:08.990 --> 00:12.490
What? Let's shoot the breeze a little longer.

00:12.820 --> 00:16.260
Tomorrow is my long-awaited 
debut as a beautician.

00:16.260 --> 00:18.430
I've got to get ready, you know?

00:18.430 --> 00:21.000
That's real admirable, achieving 
your dream like that, meow.

00:21.380 --> 00:23.000
What are you doing? That's creepy.

00:23.000 --> 00:24.790
Meow.

00:26.370 --> 00:28.750
It's all thanks to you cheering me on.

00:29.230 --> 00:31.030
Thanks, Shizuku.

00:31.030 --> 00:33.370
Here. In celebration of your new job.

00:33.370 --> 00:34.010
Huh?

00:34.380 --> 00:36.570
They said it's gonna rain.

00:37.020 --> 00:40.020
Oh, you're right. It just started.

00:40.020 --> 00:42.020
Better hurry up and get yourself home.

00:42.440 --> 00:45.020
Wouldn't wanna be late, Miss Beautician.

00:45.350 --> 00:48.320
Hey, let me cut your hair sometime, okay?

00:48.320 --> 00:50.660
Sure! That's a promise.

00:53.650 --> 00:54.880
See you later.

00:54.880 --> 00:55.910
Yeah.

00:58.980 --> 01:01.410
See you later, Tomoko.

01:11.550 --> 01:16.350
<b>Mysterious Disappearances</b>

01:11.550 --> 01:16.350
<b>Mysterious Disappearances</b>

02:37.140 --> 02:42.020
<b>Underwear, Snacks, and Scarlet Clothes</b>

02:37.140 --> 02:42.020
<b>Underwear, Snacks, and Scarlet Clothes</b>

02:42.660 --> 02:45.520
Along the path to school, running 
straight along an embankment,

02:45.520 --> 02:48.170
a multitude of cultured 
young ladies walk in procession.

02:48.990 --> 02:51.530
What a sight for sore eyes 
this school commute is!

02:51.530 --> 02:56.470
Can you feel the tsunami of youth, Oto-chan?

02:58.030 --> 02:59.280
Hey.

02:59.280 --> 03:03.350
The same situation, the same lines...
Are we in a rerun of some TV drama?

03:03.350 --> 03:04.290
Huh?

03:04.290 --> 03:06.160
Occhan!

03:07.530 --> 03:08.910
Good day to you!

03:08.910 --> 03:11.540
Good day to you, Nodoka, Mari.

03:11.540 --> 03:13.800
Good day to you, Wakazukuri-senpai.

03:15.570 --> 03:19.800
I feel like I'm getting more and more 
accustomed to the name "Wakazukuri."

03:20.290 --> 03:21.840
Well, if you'll excuse us.

03:21.840 --> 03:23.190
We'll go on ahead!

03:25.220 --> 03:29.670
I see. Uneventful daily events 
repeating themselves...

03:29.670 --> 03:33.820
Maybe adolescence itself is no more 
or less than the reruns of a TV drama.

03:34.310 --> 03:38.570
After school, let's enact another adolescent 
TV drama of our own, Oto-chan!

03:38.570 --> 03:40.040
What?

03:54.640 --> 03:58.610
I know this toilet stall well. 
Today, I'm fully prepared!

03:58.610 --> 04:00.590
I haven't overlooked a single detail.

04:12.260 --> 04:13.610
It's lunch break.

04:28.740 --> 04:30.120
So good!

04:36.560 --> 04:37.630
Nodoka-chan!

04:58.940 --> 05:00.150
Apartment wife.

05:00.710 --> 05:01.830
Oto-chan!

05:07.120 --> 05:08.990
Wakazukuri-senpai!

05:09.660 --> 05:11.320
We've been waiting for you!

05:11.320 --> 05:12.170
Yup!

05:13.150 --> 05:15.020
What are you all doing?

05:15.020 --> 05:17.350
We've been following you, Occhan.

05:17.350 --> 05:21.430
Now's our chance to speak 
with Wakazukuri-senpai again.

05:21.810 --> 05:23.790
We're heading up to the roof!

05:23.790 --> 05:25.430
Huh? Why?

05:28.480 --> 05:29.600
This!

05:31.940 --> 05:33.690
Occhan!

05:33.690 --> 05:36.690
Today's the day you grace 
my lap with your presence.

05:36.690 --> 05:38.370
But...

05:38.370 --> 05:41.690
I'm the one who brought 
that boba tea, you know.

05:41.690 --> 05:42.610
Okay.

05:43.870 --> 05:47.000
We've brought you to another 
of our middle-school gatherings.

05:47.000 --> 05:48.850
I'm sorry, Senpai.

05:48.850 --> 05:51.960
Oh, don't be! This is just 
what I was hoping for!

05:51.960 --> 05:56.410
A friend of Occhan's is a friend 
of ours, you know?

05:57.350 --> 05:59.960
Occhan! Here, have this!

06:01.750 --> 06:02.970
Thank you!

06:03.270 --> 06:08.900
Oh, right. Uname-sensei came back 
to work today. Isn't that a relief?

06:08.900 --> 06:09.970
Sure is.

06:09.970 --> 06:11.400
Speaking of which...

06:12.730 --> 06:16.730
Uname-sensei's underwear 
was the sexy black kind.

06:16.730 --> 06:17.590
Huh?

06:17.590 --> 06:20.230
When did you even see that?

06:20.230 --> 06:22.740
Oh! It was when she tripped!

06:23.030 --> 06:24.520
All of you!

06:24.520 --> 06:26.620
I've told you, bullying is wro—

06:29.010 --> 06:31.650
A-Are you all right?

06:39.440 --> 06:44.630
Yes. My eyes took advantage 
of that momentary chance.

06:44.630 --> 06:46.640
That's Mari for you.

06:46.640 --> 06:51.240
She pretends to be mild-mannered, 
but she's actually the perviest of us all.

06:51.240 --> 06:53.600
Huh? Is Mari-chan really like that?

06:53.600 --> 06:54.850
She really is!

06:54.850 --> 06:57.710
After all, Mari's family runs a bathhouse!

06:57.710 --> 07:00.160
Th-That has nothing to do with it.

07:00.160 --> 07:02.420
Occhan, please don't get the wrong idea.

07:02.420 --> 07:05.400
Occhan isn't interested in this at all.

07:05.400 --> 07:10.410
Still... Uname-sensei wears 
sexy black underwear?

07:10.410 --> 07:11.720
I never expected that.

07:11.720 --> 07:13.910
Then what kind should it have been?

07:13.910 --> 07:17.940
I thought she'd wear cuter ones. Like this.

07:24.130 --> 07:28.100
No, no. If anything, it's the demure types 
that tend toward wearing the erotic stuff.

07:28.100 --> 07:30.000
You don't get it at all.

07:38.300 --> 07:39.150
Hey!

07:39.530 --> 07:42.490
If you're after black undies, 
I wear them all the time!

07:42.860 --> 07:44.190
See?

07:44.780 --> 07:45.880
For real?

07:45.880 --> 07:47.290
Guh!

07:50.230 --> 07:53.910
I see. It's the demure types 
that wear the erotic stuff.

07:53.910 --> 07:56.540
Which means... Occhan!

07:57.800 --> 08:00.300
What kind of underwear do you wear?

08:01.540 --> 08:03.080
What kind of underwear?

08:05.970 --> 08:07.050
Cloth.

08:07.970 --> 08:09.360
Cloth...

08:09.360 --> 08:11.030
Well, no lies there.

08:16.290 --> 08:18.560
Today was a lot of fun.

08:18.870 --> 08:21.420
Yes. That sweet fugashi was so big.

08:21.420 --> 08:23.570
That wasn't what I was talking about.

08:28.230 --> 08:30.080
Are we going to the bathhouse again today?

08:30.080 --> 08:32.320
That's right. Wait...

08:32.320 --> 08:36.440
They mentioned that Mari-chan's 
family runs a bathhouse, right?

08:36.830 --> 08:39.330
<b>Baths</b>

08:39.330 --> 08:42.830
<b>Baths</b>

08:39.330 --> 08:42.830
<b></b>Vending Machines

08:43.600 --> 08:45.340
Oh! Adashino-san!

08:45.340 --> 08:47.340
And... Ogawa-san?

08:47.340 --> 08:49.010
Uname-sensei!

08:49.320 --> 08:52.750
Fancy running into you in a place like this! 
We're bath buddies!

09:01.850 --> 09:03.750
Welcome—oh...

09:04.360 --> 09:06.570
Occhan! Uname-sensei!

09:06.570 --> 09:07.860
Good day to you.

09:09.190 --> 09:10.860
Three adults, please.

09:10.860 --> 09:12.110
All right.

09:13.630 --> 09:17.540
<i>It's the older woman I've seen 
somewhere but can't quite place!</i>

09:18.820 --> 09:20.350
Is something wrong?

09:20.350 --> 09:21.290
Um...

09:21.610 --> 09:24.440
We've met somewhere before, haven't we?

09:24.890 --> 09:27.300
Have we?

09:27.300 --> 09:30.940
She works at the book store 
near the train station.

09:30.940 --> 09:32.710
That's probably where you've seen her.

09:33.190 --> 09:37.010
Oh, Midori Bookstore! I've shopped there.

09:37.010 --> 09:38.970
Thank you for your business.

09:38.970 --> 09:40.600
Please, take your time!

09:41.320 --> 09:43.860
Thank you, Uname-sensei.

09:49.230 --> 09:50.990
<i>This is my chance...</i>

09:50.990 --> 09:52.990
<i>to see those three...</i>

09:52.990 --> 09:54.990
<i>undress for their bath!</i>

09:57.990 --> 09:59.650
<i>How titillating!</i>

10:03.730 --> 10:05.910
<i>But, no. I shouldn't.</i>

10:06.670 --> 10:08.750
<i>I have my family's reputation to uphold.</i>

10:09.360 --> 10:12.010
<i>I can't allow crass thoughts 
to cross my mind.</i>

10:12.970 --> 10:16.030
You know, I really love public bathhouses!

10:16.030 --> 10:20.270
They're a place where we can all cast off 
our armor and relax together as equals.

10:22.270 --> 10:24.020
<i>Won't they hurry up and undress?</i>

10:24.020 --> 10:25.770
That's kind of unexpected.

10:25.770 --> 10:30.670
I never imagined someone as refined 
as you to be into public baths.

10:31.120 --> 10:33.030
Me? Refined?

10:33.570 --> 10:35.020
You have me all wrong.

10:35.020 --> 10:38.030
<i>They're in a chatting mood instead!</i>

10:38.440 --> 10:40.950
I'm sure I'm the exact opposite 
of what you think.

10:40.950 --> 10:42.750
I see.

10:47.790 --> 10:49.750
<i>I completely missed it!</i>

10:50.080 --> 10:52.490
<i>Occhan strips way too fast!</i>

10:54.390 --> 10:59.440
<i>While I looked away, that sexy book store 
clerk has gotten more undressed!</i>

10:56.920 --> 11:00.060
Ogawa-san, you have a really nice figure.

11:00.060 --> 11:04.560
I really don't! This is just the 
lucky result of unhealthy living.

11:01.020 --> 11:04.010
<i>But my main interest is Uname-sensei!</i>

11:04.560 --> 11:08.310
<i>I intend to confirm her taste 
in underwear with my own eyes!</i>

11:04.560 --> 11:08.310
I always wanted to be a little taller.

11:08.310 --> 11:11.410
But for some reason, it's only 
ever my rear end that grows.

11:11.410 --> 11:14.390
What's wrong with that? It's sexy.

11:14.390 --> 11:17.200
Hearing you say that isn't convincing.

11:17.200 --> 11:18.570
Are you gonna strip or not?!

11:18.570 --> 11:19.320
Huh?

11:22.020 --> 11:23.270
Well, then...

11:25.870 --> 11:27.040
<i>At last!</i>

11:27.040 --> 11:29.160
Mari, I'll take the desk now.

11:29.160 --> 11:29.840
Huh?

11:30.510 --> 11:32.180
Stay out of this, Mom.

11:32.500 --> 11:35.910
My very life hinges on my position 
at the front desk right now!

11:35.910 --> 11:37.090
Your life?

11:37.490 --> 11:40.690
<i>At long last, I'll be able to 
see Sensei's unmentionables!</i>

11:40.690 --> 11:41.350
<i>Ack!</i>

11:44.330 --> 11:46.600
<i>It's all over!</i>

11:46.600 --> 11:49.730
<i>I missed it!</i>

11:50.110 --> 11:52.110
<b>Tomi Baths</b>

11:58.690 --> 12:01.740
We are aliens from outer space.

12:01.740 --> 12:05.500
Take us to your apartment wife.

12:05.500 --> 12:10.470
Coffee milk after a bath is better than drugs!

12:10.470 --> 12:14.880
I can't condone that comparison, 
but I agree with the sentiment.

12:16.880 --> 12:18.880
By the way, Ogawa-san...

12:19.310 --> 12:21.960
you're looking after Oto-san 
again today, aren't you?

12:21.960 --> 12:25.110
Yes. Her older brother asked me to.

12:25.640 --> 12:28.520
Would you like to come and 
sleep over at my place?

12:28.520 --> 12:31.020
I'll treat you to dinner, too!

12:31.020 --> 12:34.520
We couldn't possibly put you 
through so much trouble.

12:34.520 --> 12:38.290
As a teacher, it's only natural for 
me to look out for my students!

12:38.290 --> 12:39.700
Don't fret about it!

12:41.210 --> 12:42.910
Oto-chan, what do you think?

12:43.380 --> 12:44.660
But...

12:45.110 --> 12:47.650
I have lots of snacks!

12:59.680 --> 13:00.930
What a pushover.

13:02.940 --> 13:05.430
Who gets lured in by snacks in this day and age?

13:05.740 --> 13:08.530
Adashino-san, eat as much 
as you want, all right?

13:12.620 --> 13:14.060
This is kobucha, isn't it?

13:14.060 --> 13:15.560
That's right.

13:15.560 --> 13:20.090
And this room is so chic. 
It's subdued and tasteful.

13:20.090 --> 13:22.790
I'm happy to hear you say that.

13:23.110 --> 13:25.940
It has the feel of a place where 
a master author might live.

13:26.300 --> 13:28.730
I bet someone could write a good book here.

13:28.730 --> 13:30.610
That's a novelist for you.

13:31.460 --> 13:36.670
Your taste in snacks is like what 
you'd see at a grandma's house.

13:33.710 --> 13:34.080
<b>Nanbu Senbei</b>

13:34.080 --> 13:34.460
<b>Zarame Senbei</b>

13:34.460 --> 13:34.840
<b>Mini Chestnut Manju</b>

13:34.840 --> 13:35.210
<b>Ramune Candies</b>

13:35.210 --> 13:35.590
<b>Yatsuhashi Senbei</b>

13:35.590 --> 13:35.960
<b>Jellies</b>

13:35.960 --> 13:36.340
<b>Kani Mangetsu Crackers</b>

13:36.340 --> 13:36.710
<b>Le Monde Cookies</b>

13:36.670 --> 13:37.460
Is it?

13:36.710 --> 13:37.460
<b>Mameita Snack Bar</b>

13:38.000 --> 13:40.940
Oto-san seems to like them a lot, though.

13:40.940 --> 13:45.970
See? Look at how focused she is on the ones 
made of peanuts candied in starch syrup.

13:46.490 --> 13:49.320
You bought snacks you don't 
even know the names of?

13:49.700 --> 13:52.860
Well, I'll get dinner started.

13:52.860 --> 13:54.860
Sorry for the trouble.

13:56.070 --> 13:59.360
Sensei seems really happy for some reason.

13:59.360 --> 14:04.040
<i>The Kanto region will likely experience 
sudden showers in certain areas.</i>

13:59.360 --> 14:04.360
<b>Tonight's Forecast</b>

13:59.850 --> 14:02.290
Maybe she really loves to cook?

14:15.190 --> 14:17.710
May I pay my respects?

14:24.810 --> 14:26.380
What are you doing?

14:26.880 --> 14:29.760
I'm greeting someone who's passed away.

14:30.110 --> 14:32.090
You do it by leaving gifts, like this.

14:36.350 --> 14:39.150
Is there a dead person there?

14:39.150 --> 14:41.080
I'm sure there is.

14:41.440 --> 14:43.650
Now, let's have dinner.

14:57.690 --> 15:00.670
Thanks for waiting! Dinner is ready.

15:01.120 --> 15:03.050
Thank you!

15:09.190 --> 15:11.810
I'm sorry to say it's all leftovers.

15:12.180 --> 15:15.560
Rice balls with red pickled 
ginger and sesame-salt.

15:15.880 --> 15:19.080
Braised burdock root. 
Carrots seasoned with sansho pepper.

15:19.080 --> 15:23.250
Shiitake mushrooms. Simmered lotus root. 
And those are fuki stems.

15:23.250 --> 15:25.320
It's the textbook bento box selection!

15:27.960 --> 15:32.700
It's all so plain-looking that Oto-chan seems 
as though she's been plunged into despair!

15:33.270 --> 15:34.700
Time to eat.

15:37.390 --> 15:41.210
It might look plain, but it sure is delicious!

15:49.580 --> 15:51.470
And it's healthy, too.

15:54.850 --> 15:56.980
It's already this late?

15:57.770 --> 16:00.260
We should take our leave now, Oto-chan.

16:00.260 --> 16:02.450
What? You're leaving?

16:02.450 --> 16:04.470
You can stay the night, you know...

16:04.470 --> 16:08.510
No, we couldn't put you 
through that much trouble.

16:08.510 --> 16:10.870
But the weather's set to 
take a turn for the worse.

16:10.870 --> 16:13.400
Wouldn't it be better to stay here?

16:13.400 --> 16:14.940
But...

16:14.940 --> 16:16.120
Oh, that's right!

16:16.570 --> 16:19.870
I have some delicious pudding 
for breakfast tomorrow!

16:20.650 --> 16:21.640
What?!

16:26.510 --> 16:29.900
Is putting the futons that close 
together really necessary?

16:29.900 --> 16:31.710
It's long been a dream of mine to sleep

16:31.710 --> 16:34.380
with three people lined up 
like the character for "river."

16:34.670 --> 16:37.390
Ogawa-san, I'll let you be in the middle.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.410
What?

16:38.410 --> 16:40.400
Now, let's get sleeping!

16:43.580 --> 16:46.750
<i>It's hard to sleep on the edges 
of the futons like this.</i>

16:48.740 --> 16:52.410
Wait, Oto-chan, weren't you 
going to contact your brother?

16:53.360 --> 16:54.660
She falls asleep so fast!

16:54.660 --> 16:58.290
I'm sure Adashino-san 
must have been nervous.

16:58.290 --> 17:00.580
I don't know about that.

17:01.000 --> 17:02.040
Ogawa-san.

17:03.040 --> 17:06.800
Thank you for paying your 
respects to my grandma.

17:07.230 --> 17:12.550
You can stop calling me "Ogawa-san." 
My friends call me Sumireko.

17:12.930 --> 17:17.310
Then, Sumireko-san... Thank you.

17:22.070 --> 17:24.160
Grandma...

17:24.160 --> 17:25.820
Ren-nii...

17:26.880 --> 17:29.190
So much for sleeping like this.

18:33.910 --> 18:37.300
<i>It wasn't enough. They ordered me 
to go look for more Curiosities.</i>

18:37.300 --> 18:38.670
<i>But...</i>

18:38.670 --> 18:41.680
<i>No matter what it takes, 
I will return you to your world.</i>

18:42.560 --> 18:43.690
Ren-nii...

18:44.050 --> 18:47.690
If anyone's going back, it'll be 
the two of us together, Ren-nii!

18:57.210 --> 19:00.080
<i>No... This is an ordinary street sign.</i>

19:08.620 --> 19:11.460
I found you, you monster!

19:12.590 --> 19:13.680
Stop it!

19:14.920 --> 19:16.330
Apartment wife!

19:16.330 --> 19:17.850
Are you all right, Oto-chan?

19:18.630 --> 19:22.470
Stay out of my way! My only 
business is with that monster!

19:22.470 --> 19:24.970
How can this little girl be a monster?

19:24.970 --> 19:26.250
Calm down!

19:26.760 --> 19:28.980
I figured you'd say something like that.

19:28.980 --> 19:31.000
I told you to calm down!

19:31.430 --> 19:33.730
I never said that I didn't believe you.

19:33.730 --> 19:34.860
What?

19:34.860 --> 19:37.870
I'm no stranger to this kind of thing.

19:37.870 --> 19:40.040
If you want to tell me about it, I'll listen.

19:44.470 --> 19:48.210
<i>Shizuku, can you see me? 
That thing came again.</i>

19:48.610 --> 19:52.880
<i>The one that appears on rainy nights 
and tries to open the door.</i>

19:53.950 --> 19:58.710
<i>When I opened the door before, 
I caught a glimpse of a child in red.</i>

19:59.610 --> 20:01.830
<i>Today is the day I'll catch it.</i>

20:03.480 --> 20:05.470
<i>I'm going to open the door now.</i>

20:05.470 --> 20:08.740
<i>If anything happens, contact the police.</i>

20:12.260 --> 20:13.440
<i>I'm opening it.</i>

20:15.360 --> 20:17.970
<i>Wh-What are you doing...</i>

20:26.740 --> 20:31.420
This is the last video Tomoko recorded 
before she went missing.

20:32.340 --> 20:33.630
It's been a year since then.

20:34.100 --> 20:40.190
For a whole year, I've been searching for 
a child in red who appears on rainy nights.

20:41.050 --> 20:44.980
But no one's ever believed my story.

20:45.970 --> 20:48.660
Both Tomoko and I are alone, 
without any relatives.

20:48.660 --> 20:51.700
I had no one to come looking with me.

20:52.370 --> 20:54.940
The only clue I have is this video.

20:55.590 --> 21:00.490
Even so, I'm gonna bring Tomoko back from 
wherever she disappeared to, no matter what!

21:06.830 --> 21:09.500
Yes, I see.

21:09.970 --> 21:12.160
You went together to a bathhouse, too.

21:12.760 --> 21:16.590
Yes, thank you for taking 
such good care of Oto.

21:17.240 --> 21:21.330
Yes, I have a good idea of what 
that woman is talking about.

21:22.020 --> 21:24.320
I'll return from where I am soon.

22:55.970 --> 23:00.460
That's no more than an emergency treatment. 
Do you understand, Adashino-kun?

23:00.460 --> 23:01.610
I know.

23:02.130 --> 23:04.410
Listen, make sure you never—

23:04.410 --> 23:06.420
I won't push myself too hard, old man.

23:06.970 --> 23:10.120
Now, I wonder if this one 
will be worth a ticket...

23:10.660 --> 23:13.570
<b>\hHong Yi Xiao Nu Hai\h
(Little Girl in Red)</b>

23:10.710 --> 23:12.780
The "hong yi xiao nu hai."

23:15.910 --> 23:17.380
But more importantly...

23:17.380 --> 23:20.250
I missed the scene with all of them in the bath!

23:21.330 --> 23:23.890
What are you talking about?

23:30.260 --> 23:35.020
<b></b>\h\h\h\h\h\hSorry, Sensei. Something came up,



